#     alert     causes   short                               per    num   num  non-   seqs   seqs  long       
#idx  code      failure  description                        type  cases  seqs  fatal  fail  alone  description
#---  --------  -------  -----------------------------  --------  -----  ----  -----  ----  -----  -----------
1     indf5lcc  no       INDEFINITE_ANNOTATION_START     feature      1     1  all       0      0  alignment to homology model has low confidence at 5' boundary for feature that is or matches a CDS
2     lowsim5c  no       LOW_FEATURE_SIMILARITY_START    feature      2     2  all       0      0  region overlapping annotated feature that is or matches a CDS at 5' end of sequence lacks significant similarity
#---  --------  -------  -----------------------------  --------  -----  ----  -----  ----  -----  -----------
3     lowcovrg  yes      LOW_COVERAGE                   sequence      3     3  -         3      0  low sequence fraction with significant similarity to homology model
4     mutstart  yes      MUTATION_AT_START               feature      1     1  -         1      0  expected start codon could not be identified
5     mutendns  yes      MUTATION_AT_END                 feature      1     1  -         1      0  expected stop codon could not be identified, no in-frame stop codon exists 3' of predicted start codon
6     unexleng  yes      UNEXPECTED_LENGTH               feature      3     2  -         2      0  length of complete coding (CDS or mat_peptide) feature is not a multiple of 3
7     cdsstopn  yes      CDS_HAS_STOP_CODON              feature      2     2  -         2      0  in-frame stop codon exists 5' of stop position predicted by homology to reference
8     fsthicft  yes      POSSIBLE_FRAMESHIFT_HIGH_CONF   feature      9     9  -         9      2  high confidence possible frameshift in CDS (frame not restored before end)
9     fsthicfi  yes      POSSIBLE_FRAMESHIFT_HIGH_CONF   feature      6     6  -         6      5  high confidence possible frameshift in CDS (frame restored before end)
10    peptrans  yes      PEPTIDE_TRANSLATION_PROBLEM     feature      8     4  -         4      0  mat_peptide may not be translated because its parent CDS has a problem
11    indf3gap  yes      INDEFINITE_ANNOTATION_END       feature      2     2  -         2      0  alignment to homology model is a gap at 3' boundary
#---  --------  -------  -----------------------------  --------  -----  ----  -----  ----  -----  -----------
